{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The final bell has already rung, but something won\u2019t let go...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/H-Explore-Eng.jpg?t=1747256700\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/hallwayv2.gif?t=1747256700\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate through the school, piece together disturbing memories, and confront the tragic truth that binds you to this endless day. Every loop reveals another piece of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/H-Anomalies-Eng.jpg?t=1747256700\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/anomaliesgif.gif?t=1747256700\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Observe your surroundings closely, any subtle change will decide your next move. Some anomalies are minor, others far more disturbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/TEMP-GIF3.png?t=1747256700\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you spot any anomalies, take the stairs down. Otherwise, if everything feels normal, head up. This will determine whether you escape or not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3722600?t=1747256700","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3722600?t=1747256700","capsu